KRONOS Protocol Node — Release Distribution
Copyright 2026 Oscar Haass (Ohaass)

This product includes software developed by Oscar Haass for the KRONOS Protocol.

Cryptographic primitives:
- CRYSTALS-Dilithium3 (FIPS 204) via the pqcrypto-dilithium Rust crate
- SHA3-256 (FIPS 202) via the RustCrypto sha3 crate

The KRONOS Protocol architecture (DAG + PDV + SRP) is covered by the
Spanish utility model OEPM U202630818 (filed 2026-04). International
patent protection within the 1-year priority window.

Binaries in this repository are signed with Dilithium3 under domain
"KRONOS-RELEASE-v1" by the KRONOS Protocol Intermediate Certificate
Authority. Verify with:

  kros-ca verify-file --in-file <binary> --sig <binary.sig> --bundle trust-bundle.bin
